## Deployment records are the deployment history — commit them if you want
## history beyond the 90-day artifact retention (see docs/ci-cd/DEPLOYMENT.md).
## Re-included explicitly because the `*.log` rule above would otherwise
## exclude the deploy logs that belong with each manifest.
!deploy/manifests/**/*.log
